(7763603, 1286581, 114285, '<td valign="top">I''m kind of shocked with the score, not only didn''t it ribbon it beat mine, and I thought yours was clearly better than my entry.<br/> <br/>I wonder if it was the greens in the background that put people off?</td>', 'I''m kind of shocked with the score, not only didn''t it ribbon it beat mine, and I thought yours was clearly better than my entry. I wonder if it was the greens in the background that put people off?', '2024-02-12 01:00:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7763604, 1286597, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Too cute! Congrats on the yellow, how did you get your cat there? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thanks Anita .. <br/>this is what I put in the notes in 52Frames .. <br/>it will answer your question .. xx<br/><i> <br/>was at my daughter Ali''s place ..<br/>Ben .. my son-in-law .. had built a little shelf up near the ceiling for molly .. it has been her favourite place for a long time .. she gets up there via the cat scratching tower .. <br/>they were moving house the next day and molly was wandering around a bit out of character .. 72.8% of the time she''d be up on the shelf when i was visiting .. !! .. ;)<br/>i told ben about the theme "shoot from below" .. and said how great it would be if molly was up on her shelf .. so he put her up there ..<br/>my grandson Leo helped by getting her attention so she''d be looking down ..<br/>so this was a team effort .. miss molly mostly, then ben and leo .. oh .. and me who took the photo .. !! .. ;)</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Too cute! Congrats on the yellow, how did you get your cat there?   thanks Anita .. this is what I put in the notes in 52Frames .. it will answer your question .. xx was at my daughter Ali''s place ..Ben .. my son-in-law .. had built a little shelf up near the ceiling for molly .. it has been her favourite place for a long time .. she gets up there via the cat scratching tower .. they were moving house the next day and molly was wandering around a bit out of character .. 72.8% of the time she''d be up on the shelf when i was visiting .. !! .. ;)i told ben about the theme "shoot from below" .. and said how great it would be if molly was up on her shelf .. so he put her up there ..my grandson Leo helped by getting her attention so she''d be looking down ..so this was a team effort .. miss molly mostly, then ben and leo .. oh .. and me who took the photo .. !! .. ;)', '2024-02-12 01:26:34.000000', NULL, 0),
